menu "Micro OS telnet"

    config MICRO_OS_TELNET
        bool "the shell on TCP port 23"
        default y
        help
            The telnet server and the commands of the session: the same
            shell the UART and the display show, on the local network. There
            is no authentication, and "telnet off" closes the door. A build
            that leaves it out keeps the shell itself.

endmenu
